sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as 平台管理员
    participant Controller as SystemController
    participant Service as SystemService
    participant Dao as SystemDao
    participant MsgService as MessageService

    %% 查看公告列表
    Note over Admin, MsgService: 查看公告列表
    Admin->>Controller: 进入"公告管理"页面
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 获取公告列表
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 分页查询公告列表
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回公告列表及总数
    deactivate Dao
    Service->>Service: 格式化发布时间<br/>转换状态文本
    Service-->>Controller: 返回公告列表
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 展示公告列表
    deactivate Controller

    %% 新增公告
    Note over Admin, MsgService: 新增公告
    Admin->>Controller: 点击"新增公告"
    activate Controller
    Controller-->>Admin: 展示公告编辑表单
    Admin->>Controller: 填写公告信息并提交<br/>(标题/内容/排序/是否置顶)
    Controller->>Service: 添加公告
    activate Service
    Service->>Service: 数据校验(标题/内容不为空)<br/>敏感词检测
    Service->>Dao: 插入公告记录(状态:待审核)
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回公告ID
    deactivate Dao
    Service-->>Controller: 添加成功
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 提示"公告已提交，待审核"
    deactivate Controller

    %% 编辑公告
    Note over Admin, MsgService: 编辑公告
    Admin->>Controller: 点击"编辑"公告
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 获取公告内容
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 查询公告详情
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回公告信息
    deactivate Dao
    Service-->>Controller: 返回公告信息
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 展示编辑表单(预填现有数据)
    Admin->>Controller: 修改公告信息并提交
    Controller->>Service: 修改公告内容
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 校验公告是否存在
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 存在
    deactivate Dao

    alt 公告状态为待审核或已驳回
        Service->>Dao: 更新公告信息(状态重置为待审核)
        activate Dao
        Dao-->>Service: 更新成功
        deactivate Dao
        Service-->>Controller: 更新成功
        deactivate Service
        Controller-->>Admin: 提示"公告已更新，重新提交审核"
    else 公告状态为已发布
        Service-->>Controller: 错误提示
        deactivate Service
        Controller-->>Admin: 错误提示
    end
    deactivate Controller

    %% 直接发布公告
    Note over Admin, MsgService: 直接发布公告
    Admin->>Controller: 点击"直接发布"
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 直接发布公告
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 校验公告状态为待审核
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 验证通过
    Service->>Dao: 更新status='PUBLISHED'<br/>设置发布时间
    Dao-->>Service: 更新成功
    deactivate Dao
    Service->>MsgService: 广播公告给目标用户
    activate MsgService
    MsgService-->>Service: 推送完成
    deactivate MsgService
    Service-->>Controller: 发布成功
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 提示"公告已发布"
    deactivate Controller

    %% 下架公告
    Note over Admin, MsgService: 下架公告
    Admin->>Controller: 点击"下架"
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: offlineAnnouncement(annId)
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 校验公告状态为已发布
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 验证通过
    Service->>Dao: 更新status='OFFLINE'
    Dao-->>Service: 更新成功
    deactivate Dao
    Service-->>Controller: 下架成功
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 提示"公告已下架"
    deactivate Controller

    %% 查看公告详情
    Note over Admin, MsgService: 查看公告详情
    Admin->>Controller: 点击"查看公告详情"
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: getAnnouncementDetail(annId)
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 查询公告完整信息(含富文本HTML)
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回公告详情
    deactivate Dao
    Service-->>Controller: 返回公告详情
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 弹窗/新页面展示公告详情
    deactivate Controller